hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"167","[AI-translation] Abu Ubaid, Ibn Azhar ke aazad karda ghulam (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne unhen kehte suna: Main ne Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke sath Eid mein hazri di, to unhon ne khutbe se pehle namaz se aaghaz kiya aur kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne in do dinon: Yomul Fitr aur Yomul Azha ke roze se mana farmaya hai. Rahi Yomul Fitr, to woh tumhare rozon se iftari ka din hai; aur rahi Yomul Azha, to us mein apni qurbaniyon ke gosht mein se khao."
"168","[AI-translation] Abu Ubaid, Ibn Azhar ke aazad karda ghulam (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ali aur Usman (Raziyallahu anhuma) ko Fitr aur Azha [ki namaz] padhte dekha, phir woh wapas gae aur logon ko nasihat farmai, aur main ne unhen kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne in do dinon ke roze se mana farmaya hai."
"169","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne do dinon: Yomul Azha aur Yomul Fitr ke roze se mana farmaya hai."
"170","[AI-translation] Abu Ubaid, Ibn Azhar ke aazad karda ghulam (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke sath Eid mein hazri di; woh aae aur namaz padhai phir wapas gae, phir logon ko khutba diya aur kaha: Beshak yeh do din aise hain jin mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne roze se mana farmaya hai: Tumhare rozon se iftari ka din, aur dusra woh din jis mein tum apni qurbaniyon mein se khate ho. Abu Ubaid kehte hain: Main [bhi] Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) ke sath Eid mein hazir hua; woh aae aur namaz padhai phir wapas gae aur khutba diya to farmaya: Beshak tumhare liye aaj ke din mein do Eiden [Eid aur Juma] jama ho gayi hain; jo Aaliaya [Madinah ke bahar] walon mein se Jume ka intezar karna chahe woh us ka intezar kare; aur jo wapas jana chahe woh wapas jae, beshak main ne use ijazat de di. Abu Ubaid kehte hain: Phir main Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) ke sath Eid mein hazir hua, jabke Usman ghere mein the [Raziyallahu anhuma]; woh aae aur namaz padhai phir wapas gae aur khutba diya."
